@page "/checkout"
@{ViewData["Title"]="Request your order";ViewData["Page"]="checkout";}
<section class="page-intro compact"><a class="breadcrumb" href="/bag">Your bag / Order request</a><span class="eyebrow">THE NEXT CHAPTER</span><h1>Let’s make<br/><em>it yours.</em></h1><p>Send your selection to Zahr Boutique. The team will confirm your order details with you on WhatsApp.</p></section>
<section class="section checkout-layout"><div><form id="checkout-form"><h2>Your details</h2><p class="fine">Used to prepare your WhatsApp message. This step does not place or charge an order.</p><div class="form-grid"><div><label for="customer-name">Full name <span>*</span></label><input id="customer-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="80"/></div><div><label for="customer-phone">Phone number <span>*</span></label><input id="customer-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required maxlength="24" placeholder="+961 …"/></div><div class="span-two"><label for="customer-city">City or area <span>*</span></label><input id="customer-city" name="city" autocomplete="address-level2" required minlength="2" maxlength="80"/></div><div class="span-two"><label for="customer-address">Delivery address <span class="optional">optional</span></label><textarea id="customer-address" name="address" autocomplete="street-address" rows="2" maxlength="240"></textarea></div><div class="span-two"><label for="customer-notes">Anything we should know? <span class="optional">optional</span></label><textarea id="customer-notes" name="notes" rows="3" maxlength="500" placeholder="A gift, a question, or a preferred collection branch…"></textarea></div></div><p class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p><button type="submit" class="button full" data-prepare-order disabled>Prepare my order request <span>↗</span></button><p class="fine">You’ll review the message before opening WhatsApp. Product availability, delivery costs and payment arrangements are confirmed by Zahr Boutique. <a href="/privacy">Privacy & ordering</a></p></form>
<div id="prepared-request" hidden><span class="eyebrow">READY WHEN YOU ARE</span><h2>Your request<br/><em>is ready.</em></h2><p>Nothing has been sent yet. Review the message below, then continue to WhatsApp to send it to Zahr Boutique.</p><label for="order-message">Your message</label><textarea id="order-message" rows="14" readonly></textarea><button type="button" class="button outline full" data-copy-message>Copy my request</button><a class="button full" id="send-order" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Send to Zahr Boutique on WhatsApp ↗</a><button type="button" class="text-link" data-edit-request>Edit your details</button></div>
<noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to prepare your order, or <a href="https://wa.me/@Shop.Settings.Phone">contact Zahr Boutique on WhatsApp</a>.</p></noscript></div><aside class="order-summary"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR SELECTION</span><div data-cart-items></div><div class="bag-summary" data-cart-summary></div><a class="text-link" href="/bag">Edit your bag ↗</a><p class="fine">Delivery is calculated by the store. A displayed subtotal covers products with published prices only.</p></aside></section>
